# A phone held sideways (844x390 at DPR 3): the title, Practice Easy started
# by touch, the HUD rail | grid column | wheel layout, letters tapped on the
# wheel, Clear, the pause sheet by touch, left.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 600 Word
frames 30
save wg-land-title
touch Practice. Unranked
until 120 Nothing here affects
frames 10
touch Easy — 5 letters, small grid
frames 5
touch =Start
until 900 0 / 4 words
frames 40
save wg-land-game
touch Letter
frames 6
touch Letter #2
frames 6
save wg-land-spell
touch Clear word
frames 6
touch =Pause
until 120 Leave round
frames 10
save wg-land-pause
touch =Leave round
until 300 Learn & play
frames 10
